<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Host a Service | StayNest</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Offer specialized hospitality, concierge, private chef, and wellness services on StayNest." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-beige: #FAF7F0;
            --surface-card: #FFFFFF;
            --emerald-dark: #0B1C14;
            --emerald-mid: #143528;
            --gold-accent: #D4AF6A;
            --text-dark: #121A16;
            --text-muted: #6B7770;
            --border-light: #E8E2D5;
        }

        *, *::before, *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-beige);
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .wizard-header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 50;
            background: rgba(250, 247, 240, 0.96);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            padding: 16px 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .brand-logo-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--emerald-dark);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .brand-logo-link span {
            color: var(--gold-accent);
        }

        .btn-exit {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            background: #FFFFFF;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-exit:hover {
            color: var(--emerald-dark);
            border-color: var(--gold-accent);
        }

        .service-stage {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 60px 24px 120px 24px;
            max-width: 1080px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .service-card-hero {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 28px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(20, 53, 40, 0.06);
            padding: 56px 48px;
            width: 100%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 48px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .tag-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            background: rgba(20, 53, 40, 0.1);
            color: var(--emerald-mid);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
            font-size: 38px;
            line-height: 1.18;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--emerald-dark);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 15.5px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .perks-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .perks-list li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 14.5px;
            color: #2D3732;
        }

        .perk-icon {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #E8F0EA;
            color: var(--emerald-mid);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        .interactive-preview-box {
            background: #FAF7F0;
            border: 1.5px dashed var(--border-light);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 36px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .footer-action-bar {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            padding: 16px 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            z-index: 40;
        }

        .btn-back-link {
            font-size: 14.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .btn-primary-emerald {
            background: var(--emerald-mid);
            color: #FAF7F0;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 14px 34px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .btn-primary-emerald:hover {
            background: var(--emerald-dark);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(20, 53, 40, 0.25);
        }

        @media (max-width: 860px) {
            .service-card-hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                padding: 32px 24px;
                gap: 32px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="wizard-header">
        <a href="/" class="brand-logo-link">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.3">
                <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
                <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Stay<span>Nest</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/host" class="btn-exit">Exit to Dashboard</a>
    </header>

    <main class="service-stage">
        <div class="service-card-hero">
            <div>
                <span class="tag-badge">StayNest Concierge Services</span>
                <h1 class="hero-title">Provide personalised services like photography and massage</h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">
                    Offer specialized concierge, wellness therapies, private photography sessions, chauffeur transfers, or gourmet dining for guests staying across luxury StayNest properties.
                </p>

                <ul class="perks-list">
                    <li>
                        <span class="perk-icon">✓</span>
                        <span><strong>Direct Booking Requests:</strong> Receive seamless reservation inquiries tied directly to guest itineraries.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="perk-icon">✓</span>
                        <span><strong>Service Radius Control:</strong> Set your custom city boundaries, availability hours, and equipment needs.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="perk-icon">✓</span>
                        <span><strong>Secure Payouts:</strong> Automated settlement through StayNest escrow system directly into your bank account.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="interactive-preview-box">
                <!-- 3D Service Bell Graphic -->
                <svg width="96" height="80" viewBox="0 0 92 76" fill="none" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    <ellipse cx="46" cy="72" rx="36" ry="4" fill="rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"/>
                    <g filter="drop-shadow(0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12))">
                        <ellipse cx="46" cy="67" rx="38" ry="6.5" fill="#1E2229"/>
                        <ellipse cx="46" cy="61" rx="36" ry="5.5" fill="#64748B"/>
                        <path d="M18 58 C18 42 28 26 46 26 C64 26 74 42 74 58 C68 59 58 59.5 46 59.5 C34 59.5 24 59 18 58 Z" fill="#CBD5E1"/>
                        <path d="M16 57 C22 55.5 33 55 46 55 C59 55 70 55.5 76 57 C77 58.5 76 60 72 61 C62 62.2 52 62.6 46 62.6 C40 62.6 30 62.2 20 61 C16 60 15 58.5 16 57 Z" fill="#94A3B8"/>
                        <rect x="44.2" y="16" width="3.6" height="11" rx="1.2" fill="#CBD5E1"/>
                        <ellipse cx="46" cy="16" rx="9" ry="3.8" fill="#CBD5E1"/>
                    </g>
                </svg>
                <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #143528; margin-bottom: 6px;">Service Provider Studio</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: #6B7770; max-width: 260px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    Configure your service catalog, hourly or flat rates, and instant-book preferences.
                </p>
                <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 18px; border: 1px solid var(--border-light); font-size: 13px; color: var(--emerald-mid); font-weight: 600;">
                    ✦ Draft Mode Active
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer-action-bar">
        <a href="/host/add-home" class="btn-back-link">← Back to Home Listing</a>
        <button type="button" class="btn-primary-emerald" onclick="alert('Service listing wizard will be customized as per your requirement!')">
            Continue Setting Up ➔
        </button>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
